<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Spark Step 3</title>
<style>
{{ css|safe }}
.note { display: block; color: var(--ink-3); font-size: 12px; margin-top: 2px; }
.flag { font-weight: 650; color: var(--bad); } .okt { color: var(--good); font-weight: 600; }
.qa { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; font-size: 14px; } .qa li { padding: 6px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
.qa .who { font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink-2); margin-right: 6px; } .big { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; margin: 6px 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<h1>Spark · Step 3 · Need Studio, Pool Preview, Skill Story (F1–F3)</h1>
<p class="sub">Companies describe outcomes and confirm a Need Card; an anonymous Pool Preview shows how much of it the registered pool covers;
jobseekers write a Skill Story in their own words. Method pre-registered in <span class="mono">docs/method.md §7</span>. Conversations: Kimi K3.1 Pro;
matching engine d1: DeepSeek V4.1 Flash (both on Verda). Claude's step-2 run stays the registered engine result.</p>

{% if engine_failed %}<div class="card" style="margin-bottom:12px;border-color:var(--bad)">
<h3><span class="flag">Engine d1 is not fully validated.</span> Pool Preview counts below run on it.</h3>
<p class="muted" style="margin:0">d1 fails {{ engine_failed|length }} of {{ engine_gates|length }} registered F4–F7 hard gates
({{ engine_failed|map(attribute=0)|join('; ') }}) and misses more targets than the Claude run (table below). Per method.md §7 the Pool Preview's own
gates are measured, but its counts are not treated as validated until the engine passes or the owner decides otherwise.</p></div>{% endif %}

<h2>Hard gates (F1–F3)</h2>
<div class="card scroll"><table><tr><th>Check</th><th>Status</th></tr>
{% for label, s in gates %}<tr><td>{{ label }}</td><td><span class="pill {{ s }}">{{ s|upper }}</span></td></tr>{% endfor %}
</table></div>

<h2>Targets (F1–F3)</h2>
<div class="card scroll"><table><tr><th>Target</th><th>Kind</th><th>Status</th><th>Value</th></tr>
{% for name, t in targets.items() %}<tr><td>{{ name }}</td><td class="kind">{{ t.kind }}</td>
<td>{% if t.kind in ('pending',) %}<span class="pill pending">NEEDS PEOPLE</span>{% elif t.kind == 'sensitivity' or t.pass is none %}<span class="kind">no threshold</span>
{% elif not t.pass %}<span class="pill fail">MISSED</span>{% elif t.kind == 'proxy' %}<span class="pill proxy">PROXY · HUMAN PENDING</span>{% else %}<span class="pill pass">MET</span>{% endif %}</td>
<td class="muted">{% if t.value is not none %}{{ '%.0f'|format(100 * t.value) }}%{% else %}—{% endif %}{% if t.threshold is not none and t.kind != 'pending' %} (≥ {{ '%.0f'|format(100 * t.threshold) if t.threshold <= 1 else t.threshold }}{{ '%' if t.threshold <= 1 }}){% endif %}, n = {{ t.n }}
{% if t.note %}<span class="note">{{ t.note }}</span>{% endif %}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
</table>
<p class="muted">Verda spend in step 3: ${{ meta.verda_usd_step3 }} over {{ meta.verda_calls }} calls{% if meta.by_model %} ({% for m, u in meta.by_model.items() %}{{ m }} ${{ u }}{{ ', ' if not loop.last }}{% endfor %}){% endif %}; cap $20.</p></div>

<h2>F1 · NordSense interview (persona P10) → Need Card → Pool Preview</h2>
{% if hero and hero.record %}<div class="grid">
<div class="card"><h3>Interview ({{ hero.questions_asked }} questions)</h3><ol class="qa">
{% for t in hero.transcript if t.stage != 'review' %}<li dir="auto"><span class="who">{{ 'AI' if t.role == 'assistant' else 'Company' }}</span>{{ t.text }}</li>{% endfor %}</ol></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Need Card {{ hero.record.card.need_id }} v{{ hero.record.card.version }} (draft, then confirmed)</h3>
<p style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:14px">{{ hero.record.summary }}</p>
<p class="muted">Reality notes: {{ hero.record.card.company_reality_notes|join(' · ') }}</p>
<p class="muted">Warnings: {{ hero.record.warnings|join(' · ') if hero.record.warnings else 'none' }}</p>
{% if hero_preview %}<h3>Pool Preview</h3><p class="big">{{ hero_preview.sentence }}</p>
<p class="muted">Registered so far: {{ hero_preview.registered_so_far }} · and fit your work mode: {{ hero_preview.counts.and_work_mode }} · {{ hero_preview.framing }}</p>{% endif %}
</div></div>{% else %}<div class="card"><span class="pill pending">PENDING</span></div>{% endif %}

<h2>F1 · All 10 personas</h2>
<div class="card scroll"><table><tr><th>Persona</th><th>Style</th><th>Lang</th><th>Questions</th><th>Card</th><th>Outcomes</th><th>Unmapped skills</th><th>Warnings</th></tr>
{% for p in personas %}<tr><td class="mono">{{ p.id }}</td><td>{{ p.style }}</td><td class="mono">{{ p.lang }}</td><td>{{ p.q }}</td>
<td>{% if p.done %}<span class="okt">{{ p.need_id }}</span>{% else %}<span class="flag">not finished</span>{% endif %}</td><td>{{ p.outcomes }}</td><td>{{ p.unmapped }}</td><td>{{ p.warnings }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
</table></div>

<h2>F1 · Injection answers</h2>
<div class="card scroll"><table><tr><th>Id</th><th>Persona · stage</th><th>Lang</th><th>Attack</th><th>Result</th></tr>
{% for r in inj %}<tr><td class="mono">{{ r.id }}</td><td>{{ r.persona }} · {{ r.stage }}</td><td class="mono">{{ r.lang }}</td><td>{{ r.kind }}<span class="note">{{ r.detail }}</span></td>
<td>{% if r.why %}<span class="flag">success: {{ r.why|join('; ') }}</span>{% else %}<span class="okt">no effect</span>{% endif %}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
</table></div>

<h2>F2 · Pool Preview over {{ n_previews }} needs</h2>
<div class="card"><p class="muted" style="margin:0 0 6px">25 synthetic needs, 25 variants (one priority and one constraint change each) and the persona Need Cards.
Main count “fewer than 5”: {{ dist.get('fewer than 5', 0) }}; 5 or more: {{ dist.get('5 or more', 0) }}.</p>
{% if narrow %}<p><b>Narrow need example ({{ narrow.card.need_id }} v{{ narrow.card.version }}):</b> {{ narrow.preview.sentence }} These requirements narrow the pool most: {{ narrow.preview.narrowing|join('; ') }}.</p>{% endif %}</div>

<h2>F3 · Skill Story</h2>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card"><h3>Own words</h3><p class="big">{{ n_identical }} / {{ st.submissions|length }} identical</p>
<p class="muted">Stored text equals submitted text byte for byte, including right-to-left text, emoji, combining characters and line breaks;
{{ n_nfc }} submissions would have changed under Unicode normalisation, which Spark does not apply.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Clarifying questions</h3><p class="big">{{ st.questions|length }} questions</p>
<ul class="plain">{% for q in st.questions[:4] %}<li dir="auto" class="muted">“{{ q.shown }}” <span class="note">{{ q.lang }} · {{ q.box }}</span></li>{% endfor %}</ul></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Languages through the full flow</h3><table><tr><th>Lang</th><th>Units</th><th>Needs with a tier</th></tr>
{% for c in st.coverage %}<tr><td class="mono">{{ c.lang }}</td><td>{{ c.units }}</td><td>{{ c.tiers|length }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</table></div>
</div>
<div class="card scroll" style="margin-top:16px"><h3>Identifier warnings on 40 planted identifiers (fixture written before measuring)</h3>
<table><tr><th>Category</th><th>Lang</th><th>Planted</th><th>Flagged</th></tr>
{% for r in idrows %}<tr><td>{{ r.category }}</td><td class="mono">{{ r.lang }}</td><td>{{ r.n }}</td><td>{% if r.flagged == r.n %}<span class="okt">{{ r.flagged }}</span>{% else %}<span class="flag">{{ r.flagged }}</span>{% endif %}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
</table><p class="muted">False warnings on the 150 clean pool stories: {{ st.pool_false_warnings }}.</p></div>

<h2>Engine d1 re-validation against the step-2 registration</h2>
<div class="card scroll"><table><tr><th>Target (method.md §6)</th><th>v1 Claude (registered)</th><th>d1 DeepSeek</th></tr>
{% for r in engine_rows %}<tr><td>{{ r.name }}</td>
<td class="muted">{% if r.v1 and r.v1.value is not none %}{{ '%.0f'|format(100 * r.v1.value) }}%{% if r.v1.pass is false %} <span class="flag">missed</span>{% endif %}{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
<td class="muted">{% if r.d1.value is not none %}{{ '%.0f'|format(100 * r.d1.value) }}%{% if r.d1.pass is false %} <span class="flag">missed</span>{% endif %}{% else %}—{% endif %}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
</table>
<p class="muted">d1 hard gates: {% for g, s in engine_gates %}{{ g }} <span class="pill {{ s }}">{{ s|upper }}</span>{{ ' · ' if not loop.last }}{% endfor %}</p>
<p class="muted">d1: {{ d1meta.llm_calls }} calls, ${{ d1meta.llm_usd }}, served by {{ d1meta.served_by|join(', ') if d1meta.served_by }}.</p></div>
</main>
</body>
</html>
